+{"id": 5200603, "name": "致命的邀约", "text": "你邀请法图娜女士在一个僻静之处密会……从常理来说，这样的邀请对未亡人而言是一种侮辱，但也许是因为你，她欣然赴约。", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001049, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 1, "waiting_round_end_action": [{"condition": {}, "result_text": "", "result": {}, "action": {"prompt": {"id": "5200603_prompt_1", "text": "你几番犹豫，在最后关头还是放弃了做这件恶事。法图娜一直等到日暮时分才困惑地离开了，她不知道自己躲过了怎样的一劫。", "icon": "cards/2000001"}, "event_on": 5300173}}], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "上城区:[7,12]", "icon": "rite_12", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "random_effect": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "你决心绑架法图娜", "result_text": "你很轻松地迷晕了法图娜，将她带到了和酒庄主人约定的地方。他非常满意地带走了这昏迷中的女人，并承诺处理完遗产的事后，事先说好的分账一分也不会少的。\n你知道，从此以后，你再也不会见到这个女人了，而她年幼的孩子也将失去依靠，很快消失踪迹。", "result": {"clean.s1": 1}, "action": {"event_on": 5300103}}], "settlement_extre": [], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"is": 2000062}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "法图娜已在约定地点等候"}, "s2": {"condition": {"主角": 1, "type": "char"}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你必须亲自赴约"}, "s3": {"condition": {"is": 2000316, "type": "item"}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "使用迷药"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
