+{"id": 5200701, "name": "冒险的冲动（废弃）", "text": "哲巴尔，苏丹麾下的勇士，他痴迷于古代地图中描述的宝藏与冒险，因此被贵族视为异类。现在，他来到你家，尝试寻找一个同伴。", "tips": "", "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 0, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "自宅:[2,12]", "icon": "rite_16", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": ["用盟友接待他，但你只能触发一个选项"], "open_conditions": [{"condition": {"any": {"s2": 1, "s3": 1, "s4": 1}}, "tips": "请做出明确的回复。"}], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "random_effect": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [{"condition": {"s2": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "虽然他的冒险梦想即危险又昂贵，但这是极少数你可以把注意力放在这座城市之外的机会……\n 远离被权力与欲望腐蚀的空气，追寻未知的世界，还有什么更好的选择嘛？", "result": {}, "action": {"event_on": 5300202}}, {"condition": {"s3": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "他的笑容清澈，他的梦想遥远，仿佛那城墙外的蓝天与烈日，刺痛了你的双目。于是你尽全力讥讽他……嘲笑他的梦想与家族传承。", "result": {"s1+决斗标记": 1}, "action": {"rite": 5000709}}, {"condition": {"s4": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "现在你已经没有精力去做这些不切实际的冒险了……梦想是留给幸运儿的，你只是活着就拼尽全力了。", "result": {}, "action": {}}], "settlement_extre": [], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"is": 2000054}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "鲁莽的将军"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "!s3": 1, "!s4": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "接受"}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "char", "!s2": 1, "!s4": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "嘲笑"}, "s4": {"condition": {"type": "char", "!s2": 1, "!s3": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "拒绝"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
