的体魄化作享用者的体魄。", "result": {"s4+体魄": 2, "s5+体魄": 2}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"any": {"s4": 1, "s5": 1}, "s6.体魄>=": 1, "s6.体魄<": 3}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "祭品的体魄化作享用者的体魄。", "result": {"s4+体魄": 1, "s5+体魄": 1}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"is": 2000466}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "神秘的锅"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "any": {"黑暗知识": 1, "密教徒": 1}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "此人享用头部，智慧愈加丰盈。"}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "char", "any": {"黑暗知识": 1, "密教徒": 1}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "此人享用内脏，魅力愈加照人。"}, "s4": {"condition": {"type": "char", "any": {"黑暗知识": 1, "密教徒": 1}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "此人享用肉体，体魄愈加强壮。"}, "s5": {"condition": {"type": "char", "any": {"黑暗知识": 1, "密教徒": 1}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "此人享用肉体，体魄愈加强壮。"}, "s6": {"condition": {"any": {"type": "char", "任意处置": 1}, "!主角": 1, "!怪物": 1, "!动物": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "此人被享用，魂飞魄散。"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
