+{"id": 5200776, "name": "不是故意", "text": "你把索拉薇儿骂哭的事很快在仆人们当中散播开来……", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001246, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 0, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 1, "auto_result": 0, "location": "自宅:[2,12]", "icon": "rite_22", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "random_effect": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "不久后，梅姬也听说了。她不经意地向你问起这件事。而你连忙向她赌咒发誓，大表衷心，说你原本只是看她可怜，又缺人手才带回家的，绝对没有那方面的心思……在家里与她纵欲那次实在是被逼无奈。在你心里，梅姬才是最好的！这点毋庸置疑！\n你又讲了一箩筐的好话，妻子淡淡地听着，不知道有没有当真，但至少，她对你没那么不满了。", "result": {"clean.s1": 1}, "action": {}}], "settlement_extre": [], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000083, "cost.不满": 1}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "也许妻子曾对你有所不满"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
