": 6000050}, "action": {"event_on": 5300547}}], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"counter.7000476>=": 1}, "result_title": "我什么都说！", "result_text": "看你邪恶的目光依然在自己身上扫视，他瞬间吓得浑身都缩起来了。他颤抖着嘴唇，几乎是尖叫着报出一个地方，然后哭着求你放过他。\n你派人过去搜查，果然得到了不少好东西。好吧，既然这么识相，那你就放过他好了。", "result": {"coin": 10, "card": 2000986, "loot": 6000050}, "action": {"event_off": 5300547, "event_on": 5300548}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "is": 2000771, "芮尔": 1}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "芮尔密切关注这边的进展"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "is": 2000971}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 1, "text": "奴隶贩子已被你关押"}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000973}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "有可能获得的情报"}, "s4": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000974}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "有可能获得的情报"}, "s5": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000975}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "有可能获得的情报"}, "s6": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000977}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "有可能获得的幕后之人的情报"}, "s7": {"condition": {"type": "char"}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你可以亲自，或派遣任意追随者去审问他"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
