+{"id": 5201011, "name": "无名的暗杀", "text": "你被一名潜伏的刺客袭击了……准备好应战吧！", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001298, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 0, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 1, "auto_result": 0, "location": "自宅:[2,12]", "icon": "rite_11", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {"tips": ["生存", "战斗"], "type": "fight_result"}, "tips_text": ["失败的惩罚是死亡。"], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {"r1": {"text": "你需要爆发自己的潜能来躲过这次暗杀", "type": "fight_result", "type_tips": "你的战斗和生存为你提供的骰子数量受刺客隐匿属性的影响。", "low_target": 1, "low_target_tips": "你至少需要1点成功才能存活。"}}, "random_effect": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"r1:战斗+生存-e(隐匿)>=": [1, 5]}, "result_title": "你躲开了他的第一次攻击", "result_text": "刀刃擦着你的腰滑过，映照出幽蓝的月光——这是淬毒的匕首。一击不中，刺客转身就跑，你没有追击……", "result": {"clean.s1": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"r1:战斗+生存-e(隐匿)>=": [1, 5]}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "他不过是一把刀，而究竟是谁想要你死呢？最近你得知了什么秘密？", "result": {}, "action": {"event_on": 5300134}}, {"condition": {"r1:战斗+生存-e(隐匿)<": [1, 5]}, "result_title": "刀刃上有毒", "result_text": "伤口并不深，但你迅速失去了体力……视野逐渐黯淡，你耳旁传来刺客最后的低语：哲瓦德先生希望你永远闭嘴。", "result": {"clean.s2": 1}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "is": 2000360}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 1, "text": "无法辨别身份的刺客"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "主角": 1}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你被卷入一场暗杀"}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.消耗品=": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "随身携带的消耗品或许派得上用场"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
