+{"id": 5202007, "name": "书店密会", "text": "书把人与人分开，让他们无法看见你们，那是独属于你们二人的天地。", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001307, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 1, "waiting_round_end_action": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "", "result": {}, "action": {"event_on": 5300026}}], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "商业区:[4,5]", "icon": "rite_22", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": ["对主角具有激情的角色，会被约会类事件吸引", "推进约会类事件可以增加激情，触发更多剧情", "你可以不参与这类事件", "每个约会地点只能消耗一次苏丹卡"], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [{"condition": {"!s2": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "你没有去赴约，可怜的人啊，被孤独的留在了那里，还好有书陪伴着她。", "result": {"s1-激情": 1}, "action": {"event_on": 5300026}}, {"condition": {"!s3": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "事后，你们一起收拾被晃到地上的书籍，看到有趣的东西就互相分享，轻拍对方的脸颊微笑。", "result": {"s1+激情": 1}, "action": {"event_on": 5300026}}], "settlement": [{"condition": {"s2": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "事后，你们一起收拾被晃到地上的书籍，看到有趣的东西就互相分享，轻拍对方的脸颊微笑。", "result": {"s1+激情": 1}, "action": {"event_on": 5300026}}], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"s3": 1, "!s4": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "苏丹很欣赏这种浪漫，听说后来他自己也去了几趟皇家图书馆。", "result": {"card": 2000200, "clean.s3": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"s3": 1, "s4": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "很可惜，你无法用同一个方式取悦苏丹两次。", "result": {}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "激情": 1, "妻子": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "对你动情的妻子"}, "s2": {"condition": {"主角": 1, "type": "char"}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "准点赴约，当然是你"}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "sudan", "纵欲": 1, "f:rare-s1.rare<=": 0}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "纵欲卡，品级不要高于约会人"}, "s4": {"condition": {"is": 2000200}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "每个地点都只能满足一次苏丹的卡片，但你仍然可以赴约。"}},