+{"id": 5202033, "name": "我的主人", "text": "你讨伐了夏玛的父亲，向苏丹要到了那片领地的继承权。出于意料，它的任命文书是夏玛送来的。", "tips": "", "once_new": 0, "mapping_id": 8001316, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 0, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "宫廷:[2,6]", "icon": "rite_14", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": ["这也是苏丹的意志，没有人能够阻止。"], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "作为原本领主家族最后的“儿子”，夏玛大大方方地向你跪拜，亲吻了你的双脚——如同她之前做过的那样。\n终于，你也成为了与最古老的家族并驾齐驱的领主，至于夏玛……指派一名熟悉当地情况的帮手给你，伟大的苏丹是多么体贴呀。", "result": {"counter+7100003": 3, "s1.uprare": 1, "s2-妓女": 1, "s2+奴隶": 1, "s2.uprare": -1, "s2=图片": 2, "s2-纵欲的痕迹": 1, "s2+追随者": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "身为奴隶，她不配拥有“属于自己”的东西。这是你的了。", "result": {"card": [2000402, "已拥有+1"]}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "主角": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "领地的主人，夏玛的主人"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "is": 2000082}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "夏玛"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
