风使舵的贵族们都知道，因为这件事，苏丹对你很不满意……", "result": {"clean.s3": 1, "counter-7100003": 1, "counter+7100004": 1}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"is": 2000054}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 1, "text": "勇者"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "主角": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你必须亲自上阵", "pops": [{"condition": {"f:s2.战斗+s2.体魄+s3.战斗+s3.体魄+s4.体魄+s4.战斗-s1.战斗-s1.体魄<": 1}, "action": {"pop.5204902_s2_01.self": "你该意识到，以你目前的<b><color=white>【体魄】</color></b>和<b><color=white>【战斗】</color></b>无异于是在自杀。"}}, {"condition": {"f:s2.战斗+s2.体魄+s3.战斗+s3.体魄+s4.体魄+s4.战斗-s1.战斗-s1.体魄>=": 1, "!s4": 1}, "action": {"pop.5204902_s2_02.self": "如果有<b><color=white>【情报】</color></b>支持的话，可以多一分胜算。"}}]}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "sudan", "杀戮": 1, "f:rare-s1.rare<=": 0}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你可以选择借此折断一张与哲巴尔匹配的杀戮卡"}, "s4": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.消耗品=": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "消耗品", "pops": [{"condition": {"f:s2.战斗+s2.体魄+s3.战斗+s3.体魄+s4.体魄+s4.战斗-s1.战斗-s1.体魄<": 1}, "action": {"pop.5204902_s4_01.self": "你该意识到，以你目前的<b><color=white>【体魄】</color></b>和<b><color=white>【战斗】</color></b>无异于是在自杀。"}}]}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
