+{"id": 5206628, "name": "吹响骨笛", "text": "吹响它吧！", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001246, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 0, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "自宅:[2,12]", "icon": "rite_4", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "当晚，你坐在窗边试了一下，尖锐而颤抖的音色骤然钻出，吓了你一跳。这玩意应该是用于侦察兵传令之类而设计的，而非为了追求美妙音色。你又吹了几下，确保它的声音穿过了无数烟雾，传到了该听到的人耳中。从当天晚上开始，肤色黝黑、身材高大的男人和女人们沉默着来到你的屋檐下……你养活他们，给他们看骨笛，他们慢吞吞地点点头，而后向你宣誓效忠。", "result": {"card": [2000573, "已拥有+1"]}, "action": {"event_on": 5320171}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000734}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "铁头赠给你的骨笛"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.金币": 8}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "养活更多的人，总免不了花更多的钱。你需要拿出8枚金币。"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
