+{"id": 5206635, "name": "私下调查", "text": "究竟是谁，竟胆敢调戏你家的女奴，你下定了决心要把他抓出来问罪。", "tips": "", "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 3, "waiting_round_end_action": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "", "result": {}, "action": {"event_on": 5320181}}], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "上城区:[7,12]", "icon": "rite_16", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "你发动了一些人脉，终于得到了这个人的消息。他的家族在朝堂地位远不及你，人也长得贼眉鼠眼，偏还自诩是奈布哈尼一般的风流人物，真是笑话！\n既然他敢对你家的奴隶下手，你是谁，你可是被苏丹选中来玩这场游戏的人！接下来会发生什么事，可就怪不得你了。", "result": {"card": 2000738, "s1+社交": 1}, "action": {"rite": 5006636}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "贵族": 1}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你可以亲自，或派遣一名贵族来调查此事"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
