+{"id": 5206648, "name": "奈费勒的行动", "text": "你们的方案初见成效之后，奈费勒也着手开始在自己的领地实施。按照你和奈费勒的约定，你也得给他出一半的钱。", "tips": "", "once_new": 0, "round_number": 3, "waiting_round": 5, "waiting_round_end_action": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "", "result": {}, "action": {"counter+7000292": 1, "event_on": 5320212}}], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "野外:[9,14]", "icon": "rite_4", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": ["你需要提供足够的金币"], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "不久之后，你发现奈费勒的粥棚又开了，但这一次，排队领粥的人似乎少了很多。你远远地看到了奈费勒，他朝你露出一个心照不宣的、不易察觉的微笑。", "result": {"counter+7100004": 1}, "action": {"event_on": 5320213}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.金币": 6}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "轮到你支援奈费勒了，同样是6枚金币"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
