+{"id": 5208004, "name": "为你辩解", "text": "妻子在浴室似乎和人争吵过……", "mapping_id": 8001077, "tips": "", "once_new": 0, "round_number": 0, "waiting_round": 3, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "自宅:[2,12]", "icon": "rite_16", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "为你辩解", "result_text": "仆人告诉你，今天你的妻子在浴场里和一个贵妇吵了起来，你觉得匪夷所思——梅姬是最文雅、最端庄的，你从没见过她在公开场合与谁不睦。", "result": {}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "“是因为那个贵妇说您一定会滥用纵欲卡到处乱搞……然后夫人就生气了，夫人站起来大声说，我的丈夫不是那种人，请您收回您的话，请您对我道歉！”", "result": {}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"s2.is": 2000083}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "那位贵妇确实道歉了，或是迫于你的权势，又或是她也期待着你与梅姬之间有着坚守忠诚的奇迹。", "result": {"clean.s2": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"!s2.is": 2000083}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "那位贵妇确实道歉了，或是迫于你的权势，又或是她也期待着你与梅姬之间有着坚守忠诚的奇迹。", "result": {"counter+7100001": 1, "counter+7100003": 1}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"妻子": 1}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "妻子"}, "s2": {"condition": {"is": 2000083}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "借此机会可以消除一次妻子的不满"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
