盆炭火还慌张，看到这个景象也算值回票价了。", "result": {"loot": 6000016, "counter+7100001": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"all": {"type": "item", "!s5": 1, "s4.金币>": 10, "s4.金币<=": 14}}, "result_title": "你给了他足以结交新朋友的金币", "result_text": "就当是为我，你这么安慰他……而他做得还算不错。", "result": {"loot": 6000017, "counter+7100001": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"all": {"type": "item", "!s5": 1, "s4.金币>=": 15}}, "result_title": "你安排了一名仆人为他结账", "result_text": "法拉杰开心地告诉你，现在他结交到了很多新朋友，他们都愿意花时间听他说话，而他转述了很多……你的思想。这些理念令精神空虚的贵族青年们受到了启迪。", "result": {"card": 2000100, "s1+魅力": 1, "s1+社交": 1, "counter+7100004": 1, "counter+7100001": 1}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"法拉杰": 1, "type": "char"}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "法拉杰"}, "s2": {"condition": {"is": 2000735}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "激进的群众"}, "s3": {"condition": {"主角": 1, "type": "char"}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "要使用苏丹卡的话，你必须亲自参加。", "pops": [{"condition": {"s3": 1}, "action": {"pop.5208010_s3_01.s1": "太好了，您也要参加吗！"}}]}, "s4": {"condition": {"type": "item", "any": {"cost.金币": [1, 15], "is": 2000172}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "可以放入金币或者思潮，至多能放入15枚金币。", "pops": [{"condition": {"s4": 1}, "action": {"pop.5208010_s4_01.s1": "感谢您的馈赠！"}}]}, "s5": {"condition": {"all": {"type": "sudan", "杀戮": 1, "rare<=": 1}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你可以借此折断一张不高于岩石级别的杀戮卡", "pops": [{"condition": {"!s3": 1}, "action": {"pop.5208010_s5_01.self": "必须放入自己，才能折断这张苏丹卡。"}}]}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
