+{"id": 5208015, "name": "购买头衔", "text": "盖斯家的世袭贵族头衔因买下它的贵族之死再度失落，现在任谁都有机会得到它。", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001063, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 5, "waiting_round_end_action": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "", "result": {}, "action": {"event_on": 5321025}}], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "上城区:[2,10]", "icon": "rite_6", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"s1": 1, "all": {"s2": 1, "s2.is": 2000056}}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "盖斯拿着你的钱，买下了这份薄薄的文书。他低着头，将之递给你，微微抿着唇，什么都没有说，唯有眼神微微闪烁，泄露了些许心底里的拉扯。\n他好像不知道这是你给他买的，你想了想，没有当场告诉他这件事。嘿，就当是对他当初只给了你三枚金币就说什么“扯平”的小小捉弄吧，你决定等时机成熟再把这玩意儿送给他。", "result": {"card": [2000741, "已拥有+1"]}, "action": {"event_on": 5321021}}, {"condition": {"s1": 1, "all": {"s2": 1, "!s2.is": 2000056}}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "一手交钱，一手交货，贵族的头衔在这儿也不过是件商品，只是更昂贵一些罢了。", "result": {"card": [2000741, "已拥有+1"]}, "action": {"event_on": 5321021}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.金币": 10}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你必须拿出10枚金币"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char"}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你可以亲自，或者派任意追随者去购买"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
