+{"id": 5208078, "name": "饥饿的嘴", "text": "你被这群小乞丐给赖上了，他们可真他妈的太能吃了……但做了一次好人之后，人们往往就会期待你做好人做到底……在被他们吃破产之前，赶快为他们寻思一个出路吧。", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001077, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 1, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 1, "auto_result": 0, "location": "自宅:[2,12]", "icon": "rite_18", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"s2": 1}, "result_title": "今天是充满希望的一天", "result_text": "每一张饥饿的嘴都被喂饱了，除了你的钱包之外，没有任何东西受伤。", "result": {"clean.s2": 1}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"!s2": 1}, "result_title": "空空如也", "result_text": "你的钱包和孩子们的胃一样空，但还是先担心自己吧，他们忍受饥饿的能力可比你忍受贫困的能力强多了。", "result": {}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"is": 2000887}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "饥饿的乞儿们"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.金币": 3}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "这些钱可以喂饱孩子们，至多花费3金币。"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
