+{"id": 5208108, "name": "合伙金", "text": "布缇娜开价10枚金币，只要你拿出来，她就愿意跟你合伙，承认你这里是欢愉的阁楼。", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001063, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 0, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 1, "auto_result": 0, "location": "商业区:[10,19]", "icon": "rite_1", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"s1": 1}, "result_title": "你付够了钱", "result_text": "布缇娜满意地离开了。你的阁楼终于又可以正常地做生意了，不过她的到来给了你一点小小的启发——是啊，为什么不能用你自己的人做这门生意呢？下次一定试试。", "result": {}, "action": {"delay": {"id": 52081081, "round": 4, "event_on": 5321118}}}, {"condition": {"!s1": 1}, "result_title": "你反悔了", "result_text": "布缇娜冷笑了一声，仿佛早料到了。离开之后，她对自己手下的欢愉之女严加管束，她们很难再溜出来为你工作了。", "result": {}, "action": {"event_on": 5321116}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "item", "cost.金币": 10}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 1, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你必须需要拿出10枚金币"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
