欲望，把所有的一切搞得不堪入目……", "result": {"counter+7000491": 1, "coin": 10, "loot": 6001060}, "action": {}}, {"condition": {"s1.is": 2000369}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "铁头沉默着，顺从着，甚至，有些期待着。毫无疑问，他被你彻底地改变了。\n总有喜欢他的人登上阁楼，有时是熟悉的贵妇人，有时也有男人。", "result": {"counter+7000491": 1, "coin": 4}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "any": {"is": 2000500, "all": {"counter.7000251>=": 1, "is": 2000369}}}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "你打算让谁去皮肉生意？"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
