+{"id": 5208114, "name": "黑暗之主的雕琢", "text": "如一块被包裹在泥沙之中的玫瑰色宝石，拜铃耶笃定西雅玛麻布之下的身躯充满了她自己都不知道的天赋。她向西雅玛许诺了一个仪式……而这个女人毫不犹豫地答应了。", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001145, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 7, "waiting_round": 7, "waiting_round_end_action": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "", "result": {}, "action": {"clean.2000937": 1, "prompt": {"id": "prompt_5208114_01", "text": "你没有管这件事，于是，西雅玛抱着虚妄的期待，死在了荒原之中。"}}}], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 0, "auto_result": 0, "location": "野外:[9,14]", "icon": "rite_23", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "漫长的七天等待之后，拜耶灵带着一个可怕的怪物回来了。她用麻布包裹着全身，依稀能够辨别是一名女性。拜铃耶微笑着告诉你，祂是恶臭与隐疾的女神，是侍立于密神左侧的侍女……现在祂终于找到了一具合适的躯壳得以回归。", "result": {"card": [2000938, "已拥有+1"], "clean.s3": 1}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"type": "char", "is": 2000022}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "拜玲耶想要主持这场难得的仪式"}, "s2": {"condition": {"type": "char", "is": 2000937}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "西雅玛"}, "s3": {"condition": {"type": "item", "is": 2000986}, "open_adsorb": 0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "启动这场仪式需要一份珍贵的乙太"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
