+{"id": 5208129, "name": "食物中毒", "text": "这天早上，舍馆里一片混乱，人们一边呕吐一边喊着救命，似乎是饭食中被投了毒。而投毒的凶手也很快就被锁定——", "tips": "", "mapping_id": 8001147, "once_new": 0, "round_number": 1, "waiting_round": 1, "waiting_round_end_action": [], "method_settlement": "", "auto_begin": 1, "auto_result": 0, "location": "商业区:[10,19]", "icon": "rite_11", "tag_tips": [], "tag_tips_up": {}, "tips_text": [], "open_conditions": [], "random_text": {}, "random_text_up": {}, "settlement_prior": [], "settlement": [], "settlement_extre": [{"condition": {"s1": 1}, "result_title": "", "result_text": "从做完这顿饭，给你惹出巨大的麻烦之后，就再也没有人见过哈比卜。\n他一言不发地消失——或者说，逃走了，既没有回到你的领地，也没有回自己的家乡，更没有向任何人交代自己的去处……\n你有些生气，有些困惑，但无可奈何。", "result": {"clean.s1": 1, "counter-7100004": 2}, "action": {}}], "cards_slot": {"s1": {"condition": {"is": 2000014}, "open_adsorb":0, "is_key": 0, "is_empty": 0, "is_enemy": 0, "text": "哈比卜"}}, "is_replay": 0, "auto_start": false, "start_trigger": true, "condition": {}, "on": {"round_begin_ba": 1}}
